            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-inner editorial-split"
              },
              "html": "<div><p class=\"section-label\">A night at home</p><h2 class=\"section-title\">Your gift: an evening you take care of</h2></div><div class=\"intent-prose\"><p>If you are looking for a Valentine’s gift, offer to organize the evening. The meal, groceries or takeout order are your job, so your partner does not have to plan anything.</p>\n<p>For after dinner, suggest discovering Caresse together. Start with a free demo, then decide whether you would like to create a personalized session with a paid credit.</p></div>"
            }
          ]
        },
