                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "h2",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "section-title"
                      },
                      "html": "Five things to plan for your evening"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "ol",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "ideas-grid"
                  },
                  "html": "<li class=\"idea-card \"><div class=\"idea-top\"><span class=\"idea-number\">01 / 05</span><svg class=\"idea-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\"/><path d=\"m3 6 9 7 9-7\"/></svg></div><h3>Suggest the plan</h3><p>Ask your partner whether an evening at home sounds good. A text is enough; you do not need a formal invitation. Check that you are both free and interested in the same plan.</p></li><li class=\"idea-card \"><div class=\"idea-top\"><span class=\"idea-number\">02 / 05</span><svg class=\"idea-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20.8 4.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 0L12 5.7l-1.1-1.1a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 7.8L12 21l8.8-8.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.8Z\"/></svg></div><h3>Choose food they enjoy</h3><p>Cook their favorite dish or order from somewhere you know. If you offer to handle dinner, take care of the shopping, order and tidying too. For a toast, have a glass of champagne or an alcohol-free drink of your choice.</p></li><li class=\"idea-card \"><div class=\"idea-top\"><span class=\"idea-number\">03 / 05</span><svg class=\"idea-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 2.6 6.4L21 12l-6.4 2.6L12 21l-2.6-6.4L3 12l6.4-2.6L12 3ZM21 2v4M19 4h4\"/></svg></div><h3>Get the living room ready</h3><p>Clear some space, choose comfortable lighting and make sure you can have some privacy. If you want to listen to audio, charge the phone and try the speaker beforehand.</p></li><li class=\"idea-card featured\"><div class=\"idea-top\"><span class=\"idea-number\">04 / 05</span><svg class=\"idea-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 14v-3a9 9 0 0 1 18 0v3\"/><rect x=\"2\" y=\"12\" width=\"5\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\"/><rect x=\"17\" y=\"12\" width=\"5\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\"/></svg></div><h3>Suggest Caresse for afterwards</h3><p>Listen to a free demo together to discover the voice. For personalized audio, choose your preferences together and use a paid credit. You can see if you like the format before buying.</p></li><li class=\"idea-card wide\"><div class=\"idea-top\"><span class=\"idea-number\">05 / 05</span><svg class=\"idea-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"8\" r=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"m21 15-5-5L5 21\"/></svg></div><h3>Leave the rest open</h3><p>You might want to linger over dinner, sit on the sofa or try the audio. You do not have to work through a list of activities. See how the evening goes.</p></li>"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
