                      },
                      "html": "Good to know"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "h2",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "section-title",
                        "id": "faq-title"
                      },
                      "html": "Before you plan your evening"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "container",
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-list"
                  },
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "details",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "faq-item"
                      },
                      "html": "<summary>Is this a Caresse gift card?</summary><p>No. The idea is to organize an evening for your partner and discover the app together. This page does not sell gift cards or transferable credits.</p>"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "details",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "faq-item"
                      },
                      "html": "<summary>Should I buy audio before the evening?</summary><p>No. Listen to a free demo together first. If you then want a personalized session, choose your preferences together and buy a credit in the app.</p>"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "details",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "faq-item"
                      },
                      "html": "<summary>How can I keep a surprise without deciding everything for my partner?</summary><p>You can surprise them with dinner or dessert. Discuss the audio format beforehand and choose preferences together.</p>"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "details",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "faq-item"
                      },
                      "html": "<summary>What if my partner does not want audio?</summary><p>Keep dinner and choose something else for afterwards. Talk, watch a film or pick another activity together.</p>"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "details",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "faq-item"
                      },
                      "html": "<summary>What last-minute Valentine’s gift does not need shipping?</summary><p>Offer to take care of dinner at home: groceries or takeout, dessert, and champagne or an alcohol-free drink. Afterwards, discover a Caresse demo together without buying anything first. Generating your own audio uses a paid credit.</p>"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
